  "82 LTX-2.3 + the IC-LoRA INGREDIENTS adapter: a REFERENCE SHEET (one composite picture, one",
  "clean panel per character face / character body / prop / place, black background, no text)",
  "conditions the whole clip, so the people and the room in it are the ones on the sheet. This",
  "is the breakdown's @CHARAC1 @CHARAC2 @PLACE resolved INSIDE the video model, on local weights.",
  "Converted from template_ltx2_3_ic_lora_ingredients and moved onto the dev-fp8 + distilled",
  "LoRA 0.5 stack that 74 runs (the template's distilled checkpoint is not on this box).",
  "The sheet is looped into a static video (709 RepeatImageBatch) of the output length and",
  "padded to the canvas (722), then attached as an IC-LoRA guide at frame 0 (sg1_115).",
  "Knobs: 724 sheet (ComfyUI/input), 725 optional START FRAME - to use it set sg1_198.image to",
  "['725',0] and sg1_711.value false; 715 seconds, 716 fps (717 makes 8n+1 frames), 722 canvas,",
  "sg1_128 prompt ('### Reference Sheet Description' panels, then '### Target Description'),",
  "sg1_112 negative, sg1_704 seed, 68 prefix. Trained at 768x448 x 121 frames; larger panels",
  "carry more faithfully (model card). The 2.5 adapter exists but is GATED on Hugging Face",
  "(Lightricks/LTX-2.5-22b-IC-LoRA-Ingredients, 403 for this box's account, 2026-09-27); the",
  "2.3 one is public at Comfy-Org/ltx-2.3."
